Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.88,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}Quieres que la vida cambie
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.88,0:00:01.76,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}sin cambiar tú y eso
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.76,0:00:02.84,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}es como si peinaras
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.84,0:00:03.38,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}el espejo
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.38,0:00:04.68,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}Si te levantas despeinado
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.68,0:00:05.61,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}¿peinas el espejo
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.61,0:00:06.37,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}o te peinas tú?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.37,0:00:07.18,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}El espejo es como
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.18,0:00:08.50,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}la vida y solamente
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.50,0:00:09.66,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}te puede devolver aquello
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.66,0:00:10.51,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}que le enseñas
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.51,0:00:12.01,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}Fulano quiere estar mejor
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.01,0:00:12.95,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}pero se pasa todo
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.95,0:00:14.19,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}el día agobiado
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.19,0:00:15.63,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}de mala hostia y quejándose
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.63,0:00:16.81,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}Mirando lo que le falta
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.81,0:00:17.75,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}de si la gente
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.75,0:00:19.15,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}de que si sus compañeros
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.15,0:00:20.14,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}de que si el trabajo
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.14,0:00:20.73,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}de que esto está muy
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.73,0:00:21.16,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}caro
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.16,0:00:22.01,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}Quiere que su vida cambie
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.01,0:00:22.71,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}pero llega a casa
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.71,0:00:23.60,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}y le muestra la vida
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.60,0:00:24.71,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}de alguien desesperado
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.71,0:00:25.67,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}de alguien agobiado
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.67,0:00:26.51,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}de mala hostia
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.51,0:00:28.16,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}y la vida simplemente refleja
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.16,0:00:28.68,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}eso mismo
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.68,0:00:29.97,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}Pero Mengano pilló el juego
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.97,0:00:30.91,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}y empezó a aplicarlo
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.91,0:00:31.56,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}a su favor
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.56,0:00:32.63,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}Empezó a cuidarse
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.63,0:00:33.95,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}empezó a hablarse bien
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.95,0:00:34.56,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}y empezó a dejar
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.56,0:00:35.23,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}de quejarse
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.23,0:00:36.36,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}por lo que la vida
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.36,0:00:37.03,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}no le daba
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.03,0:00:38.17,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}Y empezó a comportarse como
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.17,0:00:39.60,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}alguien que se siente capaz
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.60,0:00:40.28,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}y que ya se siente
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.28,0:00:41.02,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}suficiente
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.02,0:00:42.42,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}Y el espejo no tuvo
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.42,0:00:44.36,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}más remedio que devolverle esa
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.36,0:00:45.13,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}misma imagen
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.13,0:00:46.06,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}El espejo o la vida
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.06,0:00:46.86,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}no entienden nada
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.86,0:00:48.23,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}simplemente te reflejan
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.23,0:00:49.37,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}y te devuelven todo aquello
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.37,0:00:50.45,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}que tú das y emanas
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.45,0:00:50.93,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}Por tanto
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.93,0:00:51.83,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}cambia por dentro
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.83,0:00:52.46,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}y lo de fuera
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.46,0:00:53.39,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}se tiene que adaptar
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.39,0:00:54.21,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}por consecuencia
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.21,0:00:54.75,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}Así que hoy
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.75,0:00:55.67,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}cada vez que te pilles
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.67,0:00:56.26,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}quejándote
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.26,0:00:57.14,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}Cámbialo por algo
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.14,0:00:58.38,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}que realmente agradezcas
